Position description :
To continue our growth, PIXELSTAT seeks to hire a Business Analyst Executive who should act as bridge between clients business problems and companys technology solutions, would focus on demonstration of services and products, collaborating with stakeholders to analyze, document, and improve processes. creating reports, performing user acceptance testing, and managing project scope. This performance-based role is critical in helping PIXELSTATs Business Development unit to drive towards and close strategic deals, as we continue our business growth.
Responsibilities
Work directly with the Business Development Director, serves as the critical bridge between company clients and leads to qualified pitches and conversion of new customers.
Service/Product Demonstration : Demonstrate the companys products and services that inline to customers problem solving statement.
Requirements Gathering : Eliciting, analyzing, and documenting business needs through interviews, workshops, and user stories.
Process Improvement : Analyzing existing workflows to identify bottlenecks and recommending, designing, and implementing optimized solutions
Stakeholder Management : Collaborating with diverse teams (sales, IT, finance) to align business strategies with technical, operational goals.
Data Analysis Reporting : Creating dashboards, reports, and data visualizations to monitor performance and support decision-making.
Project Facilitation : Supporting project managers, ensuring deliverables are on track, and conducting user acceptance testing (UAT)
What You Need to Have
Proficiency in data visualization (e.g., Tableau, Power BI), SQL, and project management tools like Jira or Confluence. Keen understanding of CRMs, analytics platforms;
Strong communication, critical thinking, negotiation, and the ability to manage diverse stakeholder expectations.
Understanding of market dynamics within various industries;
Ability to meet or exceed customers expectation;
Manage multiple accounts simultaneously during the early stages of the funnel;
Be a brand advocate during all prospect interactions while identifying new opportunities that drive value;
Monitor the companys industry competitors and market conditions to identify new business opportunities; Demonstrated technical proficiency with virtual communication tools;
Strong presentation skills;
Excellent English language skills, both written and spoken.
Bachelors degree in Business, Finance, IT, or a related field
Hyderabad :: Nagpur :: Pune :: Mumbai
Fulltime
